	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"映画『トイ・ストーリー4』より、「スペースレンジャー」バズ・ライトイヤーが登場！",
			"• 顔は細やかな分割で瞳や口内まで再現。表情変更パーツは充実の３種類！色分けは成形色で再現し、裏側から触ることで目線の変更も可能。",
			"• 顔周りのクリアパーツは２パーツで再現し、着脱が可能。",
			"• 左腕のメカデザインはシールで再現。さらに腕のパーツが開閉するギミック付き！",
			"• 胸部のスイッチを押すと、背中のウイングパーツが自動で展開！",
			"• ハンドパーツは２種類付属し、さまざまなポージングを演出。",
			"• 足の裏に貼れるシールが２種類付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From the movie \"Toy Story 4\", \"Space Ranger\" Buzz Lightyear appears!",
			"• The face is reproduced with detailed divisions, including the eyes and mouth. There are 3 types of expression changing parts! The color coding is reproduced with molded colors, and you can change the perspective by touching it from the back side.",
			"• The clear parts around the face are reproduced in two parts and can be attached and detached.",
			"• The mechanical design of the left arm is reproduced with Seal. It also comes with a gimmick that allows the arm parts to open and close!",
			"• When you press the switch on the chest, the wing parts on the back will automatically deploy!",
			"• Two types of hand parts are included to create various poses.",
			"• Comes with two types of seals that can be attached to the soles of the feet."
		]
	},
